{"title":"1977 AHSME Problems/Problem 18","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_18\">Problem 18</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1977_AHSME_Problems/Problem_18&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 18\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/5/b/c5ba4fa4829cb4897af6dbab5fe894d0780427b5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=(\\log_23)(\\log_34)\\cdots(\\log_n[n+1])\\cdots(\\log_{31}32)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"373\" height=\"18\" /> then \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/f/6/af6b86a610f7406574609ad6cb9f47cde2f96c2a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) }4&lt;y&lt;5\\qquad \\textbf{(B) }y=5\\qquad \\textbf{(C) }5&lt;y&lt;6\\qquad \\textbf{(D) }y=6\\qquad \\\\ \\textbf{(E) }6&lt;y&lt;7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"1052\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1977_AHSME_Problems/Problem_18&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Solution by e_power_pi_times_i\n</p><p><br />\nNote that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/8/81892f20d43db3076fb881a38e42d3d13f08572a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_{a}b = \\dfrac{\\log{b}}{\\log{a}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -16px\" width=\"105\" height=\"41\" />. Then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/5/9/959e6f8e4e278c4d9c6c3f829d55853fe6c374fc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=(\\dfrac{\\log3}{\\log2})(\\dfrac{\\log4}{\\log3})\\cdots(\\dfrac{\\log32}{\\log31}) = \\dfrac{\\log32}{\\log2} = \\log_232 = \\boxed{\\text{(B) }y=5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -16px\" width=\"489\" height=\"41\" />.\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017172358\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.006 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.006 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 21/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1052/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:15185:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017172358 and revision id 81239. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}